.TH "MPI_FINALIZE" "3" "Sep 16, 2026" "" "Open MPI"
.sp
\fI\%MPI_Finalize\fP — Terminates MPI world model.
.SH SYNTAX
.SS C Syntax
.INDENT 0.0
.INDENT 3.5
.sp
.EX
